1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,601
Is that egg still good?

2
00:00:01,962 --> 00:00:05,211
This test tells you, plus two more tricks.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:05,968
One.

4
00:00:06,329 --> 00:00:07,851
Press the flat of a knife on a

5
00:00:07,861 --> 00:00:10,472
clove, and the skin slides off.

6
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:11,339
Two.

7
00:00:11,515 --> 00:00:13,150
Put an egg in water.

8
00:00:13,511 --> 00:00:16,053
If it sinks flat, it's fresh.

9
00:00:16,344 --> 00:00:18,851
If it floats, throw it away.

10
00:00:19,067 --> 00:00:19,809
Three.

11
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:22,505
Run the loaf under the tap, and bake

12
00:00:22,515 --> 00:00:25,997
it at 160 degrees Celsius for ten minutes.

13
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,022
Full guide on the channel.
